<view class="page movement-page {{careMode?'care-mode':''}}">
  <view class="movement-heading"><view><text class="eyebrow">办完事，也走得更舒服</text><text class="title">顺路动一动</text></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="care">{{careMode?'标准字号':'大字模式'}}</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</view>
  <block wx:if="{{ready}}">
    <view class="section movement-source"><text class="eyebrow">{{source}}</text><text class="route">{{route}}</text><text class="muted">{{original}}</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{status}}" class="notice" role="status">{{status}}</view>
    <view class="section"><text class="heading">这一趟怎么走</text>
      <view class="modes"><button class="{{settings.mode==='easy'?'primary':'secondary'}}" data-mode="easy" bindtap="mode">全程轻松走</button><button id="movement-alternating" class="{{settings.mode==='alternating'?'primary':'secondary'}}" data-mode="alternating" bindtap="mode">轻快交替走</button></view>
      <view class="fields"><label>希望步行（分钟）<input type="number" value="{{settings.targetMinutes}}" data-key="targetMinutes" bindinput="field"/></label><label>比原方案最多多用（分钟）<input type="number" value="{{settings.maxExtraMinutes}}" data-key="maxExtraMinutes" bindinput="field"/></label><label>我的轻松步速（米/秒）<input type="digit" value="{{settings.easyMps}}" data-key="easyMps" bindinput="field"/></label><label wx:if="{{settings.mode==='alternating'}}">我能舒服接受的稍快步速（米/秒）<input type="digit" value="{{settings.briskMps}}" data-key="briskMps" bindinput="field"/></label></view>
      <button class="secondary" bindtap="returnEasy">{{settings.returnEasy?'✓ 返程轻松走':'返程沿用所选节奏'}}</button><text class="muted">买完东西后可慢慢回家。步速按舒适程度选择，路口或拥挤路段以现场通行为先；感到不适就停止运动安排。</text>
      <button class="secondary" bindtap="advanced">{{advanced?'收起':'展开'}}节奏与连续步行设置</button>
      <view wx:if="{{advanced}}" class="fields"><block wx:if="{{settings.mode==='alternating'}}"><label>开始先轻松走（分钟）<input type="number" value="{{settings.warmMinutes}}" data-key="warmMinutes" bindinput="field"/></label><label>每段稍快走（分钟）<input type="number" value="{{settings.briskMinutes}}" data-key="briskMinutes" bindinput="field"/></label><label>每段轻松调整（分钟）<input type="number" value="{{settings.recoverMinutes}}" data-key="recoverMinutes" bindinput="field"/></label></block><label>连续步行上限（0为不限）<input type="number" value="{{settings.continuousMinutes}}" data-key="continuousMinutes" bindinput="field"/></label><text class="muted">只有原行程中已核验的歇脚点才算休息，等灯和逛店不算坐下休息。</text></view>
      <button id="movement-calculate" class="primary" bindtap="calculate">安排这一趟怎么走</button><view class="modes"><button id="movement-save" class="secondary" bindtap="save">保存步行偏好</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="load">载入保存的偏好</button></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="section movement-result"><text class="eyebrow">{{demo?'离线示例':'已选路线'}} · 计划参考</text><text class="heading">{{preview.feasible?'这趟时间安排可行':'需要调整这趟安排'}}</text><view wx:for="{{preview.issues}}" wx:key="*this" class="error">{{item}}</view><text class="total">{{preview.summary}}</text><text class="route">{{preview.returnText}}</text><text class="muted">{{preview.brisk}} · {{preview.other}}</text><text class="route">{{preview.extra}}</text><text class="goal">{{preview.goal}}</text><text class="muted">以上是计划值，不是已完成运动量，也不据此判断运动强度或消耗热量。</text>
      <view class="leg" wx:for="{{preview.legs}}" wx:key="id"><text class="place-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="route">{{item.time}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.stop}}</text><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="leg">{{openLeg===item.id?'收起':'查看'}}这一段的步行节奏</button><view wx:if="{{openLeg===item.id}}"><view class="phase {{phase.kind}}" wx:for="{{item.phases}}" wx:for-item="phase" wx:key="id"><text>{{phase.label}}</text><text class="muted">{{phase.detail}}</text></view></view></view>
      <button class="secondary" bindtap="notes">估算依据与待确认信息</button><view wx:if="{{showNotes}}"><text class="muted">复用已选行程距离，重新核算步速、营业等待及等灯假设。不增加地图请求，不识别实际路口、坡度或路面。</text><text wx:for="{{preview.notes}}" wx:key="*this" class="muted">{{item}}</text></view><text class="muted">节奏是路段内的示意安排；在安全位置停下再查看手机，不作逐路口导航。</text><button id="movement-copy" class="secondary" disabled="{{!preview.feasible}}" bindtap="copy">复制步行安排</button>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
